  "bodyHtml": "<div id=\"page_description\"><h2 class=\"group\">Knowledge Portal Network</h2><p>The Knowledge Portal Network (KPN) is an ecosystem of interconnected web portals that facilitate innovative and intuitive analysis and visualization of biomedical data. Explore our various portals below.</p><div class=\"kpn-individual-portal\"><div class=\"portal-logo\"><p><img src=\"https://kp4cd.org/sites/default/files/images/aging_small.svg\" width=\"118\"></p></div><div class=\"portal-title\">Aging Knowledge Portal<br><a href=\"https://aging.hugeamp.org/\">Learn more</a></div></div><div class=\"kpn-individual-portal\"><div class=\"portal-logo\"><p><img src=\"https://kp4cd.org/sites/default/files/images/a2fkp_for_noel.png\" width=\"118\"></p></div><div class=\"portal-title\">Association to Function Knowledge Portal<br><a href=\"https://a2f.hugeamp.org/\">Learn more</a></div></div><div class=\"kpn-individual-portal\"><div class=\"portal-logo\"><p><img src=\"https://kp4cd.org/sites/default/files/images/vision_genomics2.png\" width=\"118\"></p></div><div class=\"portal-title\">Vision Genomics Portal<br><a href=\"https://hugeamp.org/research.html?pageid=vision_landing\">Learn more</a></div></div><div class=\"kpn-individual-portal\"><div class=\"portal-logo\"><p><img src=\"https://kp4cd.org/sites/default/files/images/kidney_small.svg\" width=\"118\"></p></div><div class=\"portal-title\">Kidney Disease Knowledge Portal<br><a href=\"https://kidney.hugeamp.org/\">Learn more</a></div></div><div class=\"kpn-individual-portal\"><div class=\"portal-logo\"><p><img src=\"https://kp4cd.org/sites/default/files/images/autoimmune_small.svg\" width=\"118\"></p></div><div class=\"portal-title\">Autoimmune Disease Knowledge Portal<br><a href=\"https://autoimmune.hugeamp.org/\">Learn more</a></div></div><div class=\"kpn-individual-portal\"><div class=\"portal-logo\"><p><img src=\"https://kp4cd.org/sites/default/files/images/ocular_small.svg\" width=\"118\"></p></div><div class=\"portal-titl